{"availability":"available","full":"exterminatorrat/simrun","name":"simrun","description":"Local-first route editor and explicitly simulated GPX activity studio.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-27T05:25:22Z","updated":"2026-10-16T02:47:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://simrun.vercel.app","topics":["gpx","local-first","maplibre","pwa","route-planner","typescript","valhalla","vercel"],"demo":"https://simrun.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:42.036Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:42.036Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:42.036Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T14:53:02.957Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T11:45:48.199Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:42.036Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Local-first route editor and explicitly simulated GPX activity studio."],"features":["Routing: cancellable, throttled Valhalla requests (never automobile costing) with walk, hike, road and mountain-bike profiles; over-long routes get a clear public-limit message (about 100 km on foot, 150 km by bike)…","Simulation: deterministic and seeded; terrain-aware pacing from a centered 30 m smoothed grade with asymmetric uphill/downhill cost; weather presets that scale duration and deepen cardiac drift; estimated power, cadence…","Import/export: GPX, KML and GeoJSON in; GPX (with opt-in power/cadence/temperature extensions), TCX, turn-by-turn cue-sheet CSV, SVG profiles and JSON backup out.","Analysis and library: heart-rate zones, a pace/speed histogram and per-unit split charts; tags, search, sort, drag-and-drop import and a storage estimate.","Local-first: IndexedDB history and drafts with an explicitly labeled Session only fallback; offline app shell via service worker."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/exterminatorrat/simrun/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"41c56d409